title: "Adaptive Pathways for App Inventor: data pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible data pipeline for an explainable skill-gap and next-step recommendation pilot for
  MIT App Inventor: ingestion of public and openly licensed projects, parsing with aiatools,
  skill profiles, clustering, a draft skill-gap taxonomy, a next-step resource catalog and a data report.
type: software
